#: manual/api/dual.md:226
msgid "The checked forms return `Result[Dual[T], ArithmeticError]` from [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) instead of producing infinities or NaN. The [checked API](checked.md) re-exports the types they use."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/dual.md:233
msgid "Divides with the quotient rule and reports invalid divisions as errors."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/dual.md:240
msgid "The value $a / c$ is computed first with `T`'s `div_checked`; the tangent $(bc - ad) / c^2$ is then computed with a second `div_checked` call. The first error is returned unchanged. For `Double` the errors are:"
